  "power": "Pre-specify a minimum of 1,000 possessions per play type and a target SE of 0.03 PPP for the contrast. Compute by bootstrap resampling at the game level. Report the achieved SE for each cell and drop cells below the minimum.",
  "controls": "Game state (score margin, period, clock), lineup and pace, team and opponent strength, with random effects for team and game. Own-sequence lags are built only from possessions before the predicted one. Label validation is a precondition: backfill and team-identity checks must pass on the derivation seasons before any effect is estimated.",
